IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `vic-nouns`
IMPORT `vic-interpretation-time`
IMPORT `vic-part4-a-aids`

-- Tests for Part IV, ss 35 to 37, 38AAA, 38AA, 38EA(2), 38M to 38P and 39 to 39B. Each expected value is written by hand from the section named beside it.

§ `s 35`

-- s 35(a): a construction that promotes the purpose is preferred to one that does not; the text does not say how two promoting or two non-promoting constructions rank, nor the converse.
#ASSERT `s35(a) the first construction is preferred to the second` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(a) the first construction is preferred to the second` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s35(a) the first construction is preferred to the second` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s35(a) the first construction is preferred to the second` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 35(b): consideration may be given to any relevant matter or document; the text does not say about an irrelevant one.
#ASSERT `s35(b) consideration may be given to the matter or document` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(b) consideration may be given to the matter or document` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 35(b)(i) to (iv): four named kinds; the list is not limited.
#ASSERT `s35(b)(i)-(iv) the matter or document is one the paragraph names` VicIndicationProvidedByTheEnactmentAsPrintedByAuthorityIncludingPunctuation EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(b)(i)-(iv) the matter or document is one the paragraph names` VicReportOfProceedingsInAHouseOfParliament EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(b)(i)-(iv) the matter or document is one the paragraph names` VicExplanatoryMemorandumOrOtherDocumentLaidBeforeAHouse EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(b)(i)-(iv) the matter or document is one the paragraph names` VicReportOfARoyalCommissionOrSimilarBody EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s35(b)(i)-(iv) the matter or document is one the paragraph names` VicAnyOtherMatterOrDocument EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 36`

-- The 1 January 2001 test: passed on or after 1 January 2001, or inserted by an enactment passed on or after it.
#ASSERT `s36 the Act is passed or the instrument made on or after 1 January 2001, or the item is inserted by an enactment passed or made on or after that date` (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the Act is passed or the instrument made on or after 1 January 2001, or the item is inserted by an enactment passed or made on or after that date` (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the Act is passed or the instrument made on or after 1 January 2001, or the item is inserted by an enactment passed or made on or after that date` (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 31 12 2000)) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the Act is passed or the instrument made on or after 1 January 2001, or the item is inserted by an enactment passed or made on or after that date` (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 1 1 2001)) EQUALS TRUE
-- s 36(1)(a),(b), (2): headings to Chapters, Parts, Divisions, Subdivisions and Schedules, and Schedules, form part of the Act, whatever the date.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAChapterPartDivisionOrSubdivision (Date 1 1 1990) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToASchedule (Date 1 1 1990) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicScheduleItself (Date 1 1 1990) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(3C): a provision number forms part whether passed before, on or after 1 January 2001.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicProvisionNumber (Date 1 1 1990) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicProvisionNumber (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(1A): headings to Parts, Divisions and Subdivisions of a Schedule, on the 1 January 2001 test.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAPartDivisionOrSubdivisionOfASchedule (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAPartDivisionOrSubdivisionOfASchedule (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAPartDivisionOrSubdivisionOfASchedule (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 1 1 2001)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(2A): headings to sections, clauses, regulations, rules, items, and to tables, columns, examples, diagrams, notes and forms.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToASectionClauseRegulationRuleOrItem (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToASectionClauseRegulationRuleOrItem (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToASectionClauseRegulationRuleOrItem (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 31 12 2000)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToATableColumnExampleDiagramNoteOrForm (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 1 6 2002)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToATableColumnExampleDiagramNoteOrForm (Date 15 3 2010) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(2B): headings to Orders of court or tribunal rules, and to Parts of such Orders.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAnOrderOfCourtOrTribunalRules (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAnOrderOfCourtOrTribunalRules (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicHeadingToAPartOfSuchAnOrder (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 2 2 2004)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(3): no marginal note, footnote or endnote forms part.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicMarginalNote (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicFootnote (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicEndnote (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 36(3A): an example, diagram or note at the foot of a provision, on the 1 January 2001 test.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicExampleAtTheFootOfAProvision (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicExampleAtTheFootOfAProvision (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicDiagram (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 1 1 2001)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicNoteAtTheFootOfAProvision (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 36(3B): punctuation, on the same test.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicPunctuation (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicPunctuation (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 36(3D), (3E): printed before the title, or after the endnotes: does not form part.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicExplanatoryMemorandumOrTableOfProvisionsBeforeTheTitle (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicIndexOrOtherMaterialAfterTheEndnotes (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An item the section does not name.
#ASSERT `s36 the item forms part of the Act or subordinate instrument` VicAnyOtherItem (Date 1 1 2005) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 36(4): subsection (3) does not prevent consideration under s 35(b) of a marginal note, footnote, endnote or heading that does not form part.
#ASSERT `s36(4) subsection (3) prevents consideration under s 35(b) of the item` VicMarginalNote EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36(4) subsection (3) prevents consideration under s 35(b) of the item` VicFootnote EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36(4) subsection (3) prevents consideration under s 35(b) of the item` VicEndnote EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36(4) subsection (3) prevents consideration under s 35(b) of the item` VicHeadingToASectionClauseRegulationRuleOrItem EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36(4) subsection (3) prevents consideration under s 35(b) of the item` VicPunctuation EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 36A`

#ASSERT `s36A(2) s 36A applies to the example` (Date 31 12 2000) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36A(2) s 36A applies to the example` (Date 1 1 2001) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36A(2) s 36A applies to the example` (Date 31 12 2000) (JUST (Date 1 1 2001)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36A(1) the example has the effect on the meaning of the provision` VicExampleExtendsTheMeaning TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36A(1) the example has the effect on the meaning of the provision` VicExampleIsExhaustive TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36A(1) the example has the effect on the meaning of the provision` VicExampleLimitsTheMeaning TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36A(1) the example has the effect on the meaning of the provision` VicExampleExtendsTheMeaning FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36A(1) the example has the effect on the meaning of the provision` VicExampleExtendsTheMeaning TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 36B`

#ASSERT `s36B(1) the thing is a legislative item` VicPenalty EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(1) the thing is a legislative item` VicExample EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(1) the thing is a legislative item` VicNote EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(1) the thing is a legislative item` VicSomethingElse EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36B(2) the legislative item is taken to be at the foot of the provision` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(2) the legislative item is taken to be at the foot of the provision` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s36B(2) the legislative item is taken to be at the foot of the provision` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s36B(3) s 36B applies to the legislative item` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(3) s 36B applies to the legislative item` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(3) s 36B applies to the legislative item` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s36B(4) s 36B has effect for the purpose` VicSection111OfTheSentencingAct1991 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(4) s 36B has effect for the purpose` VicSection36_3AOfThisAct EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(4) s 36B has effect for the purpose` VicSection36AOfThisAct EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s36B(4) s 36B has effect for the purpose` VicAnyOtherPurpose EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 37`

#ASSERT `s37 the word includes the other` VicWordImportingAGender VicEveryOtherGender FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s37 the word includes the other` VicWordInTheSingular VicThePlural FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s37 the word includes the other` VicWordInThePlural VicTheSingular FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s37 the word includes the other` VicWordInTheSingular VicThePlural TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s37 the word includes the other` VicWordInThePlural VicEveryOtherGender FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `ss 38AAA, 38AA, 38EA(2)`

-- s 38AAA: from the date the name is changed, and for any period on or after it.
#ASSERT `s38AAA the reference is taken to be a reference to the Department by its new name for the day in question` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 7 2020) (Date 1 7 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38AAA the reference is taken to be a reference to the Department by its new name for the day in question` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 7 2020) (Date 30 6 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38AAA the reference is taken to be a reference to the Department by its new name for the day in question` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 7 2020) (Date 2 7 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38AAA the reference is taken to be a reference to the Department by its new name for the day in question` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 7 2020) (Date 2 7 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38AA(1),(1A) the publisher of the standard the reference points at` VicAustralianStandardOrASFollowedByANumber EQUALS VicStandardsAustralia
#ASSERT `s38AA(1),(1A) the publisher of the standard the reference points at` VicAustralianNewZealandStandardOrASNZSFollowedByANumber EQUALS VicStandardsAustraliaAndTheStandardsCouncilOfNewZealandJointly
#ASSERT `s38AA(1),(1A) the publisher of the standard the reference points at` VicAnyOtherReference EQUALS VicNoPublisherTheTextNames
#ASSERT `s38AA(2) a reference to Standards Australia includes the Standards Association of Australia as constituted on the day` "Standards Association of Australia" (Date 30 6 1999) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38AA(2) a reference to Standards Australia includes the Standards Association of Australia as constituted on the day` "Standards Association of Australia" (Date 1 7 1999) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38AA(2) a reference to Standards Australia includes the Standards Association of Australia as constituted on the day` "Another body" (Date 30 6 1999) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38AA(3) a reference to the Standards Association of Australia is a reference to Standards Australia on the day` "Standards Association of Australia" (Date 1 7 1999) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38AA(3) a reference to the Standards Association of Australia is a reference to Standards Australia on the day` "Standards Association of Australia" (Date 30 6 1999) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38AA(3) a reference to the Standards Association of Australia is a reference to Standards Australia on the day` "Another body" (Date 1 7 1999) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 38EA(2): applies to an Act passed or instrument made on or after 1 July 2015, or to an earlier one into which the reference is inserted on or after that date and which had none immediately before it.
#ASSERT `s38EA(2) s 38EA applies to the Act or subordinate instrument` (Date 1 7 2015) NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38EA(2) s 38EA applies to the Act or subordinate instrument` (Date 30 6 2015) NOTHING FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38EA(2) s 38EA applies to the Act or subordinate instrument` (Date 30 6 2015) (JUST (Date 1 7 2015)) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38EA(2) s 38EA applies to the Act or subordinate instrument` (Date 30 6 2015) (JUST (Date 1 7 2015)) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38EA(2) s 38EA applies to the Act or subordinate instrument` (Date 30 6 2015) (JUST (Date 30 6 2015)) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `ss 38M to 38P`

#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` TRUE VicOnAnApprovedAlternativePublicationInternetSite EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` TRUE VicInAPrescribedManner EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` TRUE VicOnAPrescribedPlatform EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` TRUE VicInSomeOtherWay EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` TRUE VicInAPrintNewspaperCirculatingGenerallyInVictoria EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(1) the requirement to publish in a print newspaper is taken by this subsection to have been met` FALSE VicInAPrescribedManner EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(2) the requirement to provide, distribute or use a copy of the notice is taken to have been met` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38M(2) the requirement to provide, distribute or use a copy of the notice is taken to have been met` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38M(2A) subsections (1) and (2) apply to the requirement` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(2A) subsections (1) and (2) apply to the requirement` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38M(3) s 38M applies to the entity or document` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(3) s 38M applies to the entity or document` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38M(4) s 38M limits or exempts the thing` VicTheMannerOrFormInWhichANoticeRequiredToBePublishedMayBePublished EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(4) s 38M limits or exempts the thing` VicAnEntityFromAnotherObligationAboutPublicationOtherThanInAPrintNewspaper EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38M(4) s 38M limits or exempts the thing` VicAnyOtherThingS38MMightLimit EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38N the Internet site is an approved alternative publication Internet site` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38N the Internet site is an approved alternative publication Internet site` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38O(2)(a) the guidelines have been published as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38O(2)(a) the guidelines have been published as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38O(2)(a) the guidelines have been published as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38O(2)(a) the guidelines have been published as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38P the entity has complied with the duty to have regard to the guidelines` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s38P the entity has complied with the duty to have regard to the guidelines` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s38P the entity has complied with the duty to have regard to the guidelines` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s38P the entity has complied with the duty to have regard to the guidelines` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

